+RELEASE_TYPE: minor
+
+This release adds an experimental ``backend="hegel"`` setting, which generates
+inputs with `libhegel <https://hegel.dev/reference/libhegel>`__, the native
+engine behind the Hegel family of property-based testing libraries, now linked
+into Hypothesis's native extension. Shrinking, the database, and everything else
